        {
          "id": "9bc55945-2f40-490e-a086-aada178dc834",
          "memory": "On September 26, 2026, User, Maya and Leo debriefed their September 25 lunch at Mario's, saying the pizza hit the spot and they were still craving garlic knots. User walked home craving another, Leo praised perfect crust and elite cheese pull but said olives were too salty, and agreed with User to skip olives next time while Maya would get extra knots. They joked the crying suit guy would approve with the 'never go back to work' slogan still stuck in their heads.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d87aa7e4-32c8-4f68-8bea-841a907c9bc5",
          "memory": "For the September 25, 2026 lunch at Mario's, User walked 10 minutes, Maya said the bus home was fast for once, and Leo said he circled forever looking for parking, sharing parking karma updates on September 26, 2026.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2d9b4e9-7234-491b-9c72-745bf7c1be42",
          "memory": "On the night of September 25, 2026, Leo played the chaotic co-op cooking game for about an hour with feral randoms, while User skipped it and passed out from pizza coma and Maya went straight to the couch after the bus home, as recapped on September 26, 2026.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "49990bbb-66a0-4d04-884b-72f6aaeb5940",
          "memory": "For dinner around September 25-26, 2026, Leo had canned soup on the night of September 25 and said he would do it again, while User debated between soup and toast or leftover pasta for September 26, with Maya calling it a cozy food weekend and Leo joking grandma gang rise up.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "0e682a99-7a15-4874-acde-e19a7f71631d",
          "memory": "On September 26, 2026, Maya was making tea while chatting with User and Leo about feeling cold in fall jackets, with User asking for chamomile and Leo asking virtually for the weird lemon tea, which Maya remembered as one weird one for Leo and chamomile for User.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "eb7b5401-d7a8-4fd6-9707-8adeb241afa0",
          "memory": "On September 26, 2026, Leo proposed one round of the co-op cooking game that night, Maya said maybe depending how lazy she felt, and User said User could do one round later with no promises not to burn stuff, with Leo restating the two-fires-max house rule.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "157943da-0498-4371-8d9c-8396b70be393",
          "memory": "By September 26, 2026, Maya said her legs were finally not dead from Monday leg-day soreness and stairs no longer hurt, saying she might actually go to the gym on September 27, with Leo joking leg day should still be illegal.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d15806a5-3dc0-4d43-b5b3-f12942fe1660",
          "memory": "On September 26, 2026, Leo said his kitchen is a mess again with ecosystem reboot just two days after clearing it, with Maya reacting nooo you just cleared it and User joking that record lasted like two days, which Leo called rude but accurate.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
